<title>BERMUDA: Bermuda exchange lists Russian stock certificates.</title>
<headline>Bermuda exchange lists Russian stock certificates.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Bermuda 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nineteen equity certificates making up ING Barings' Russian Depositary Certificate Program will be listed on the Bermuda Stock Exchange, ING and the exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The exchange said in a joint news release with ING that the Russian certificates would be the first depositary receipts to be traded there.</p>
<p>-- Miami newsroom - 305-374-5013.</p>
</text>
